{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Keru and the Guardians of the Universe",
    "steam_appid": 3497440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keru</strong> is the youngest (and clumsiest) of the Guardians of the Universe of Love, but his destiny is not to stay at home... Help Keru in repelling the invasion of the Octodemons from the Universe of Chaos, and restablish the rule of love for higher glory of the Octopus God!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keru and the Guardians of the Universe is a top down puzzle shooter featuring octopuses capable of acquiring and using elemental power through arrows and other projectiles. The game has both single player and local multiplayer game modes for up to 4 players. This is a family game aimed at kids, but enjoyable for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure mode follows Keru, Guardian of Love, in his quest to match octopette couples while fighting invading octodemons, acquiring elemental powers, and solving puzzles through the use of elementally imbued arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the Universe - 8 planets are awaiting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain elemental powers - yes, love is an elemental power, didn't you know that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight octodemons - they are not bad, they are terrible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match octopettes - you are the Guardian of Love, remember?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses - some Octodemons need capital 'Os'!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles - lots of items react to different elemental powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your lost family - you could have never told you were the son of the Octopus Gods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other available modes are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op for 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local competitive for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local competitive for 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Futbito! (soccer with arrows for 2 or 4 players</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keru</strong> is the youngest (and clumsiest) of the Guardians of the Universe of Love, but his destiny is not to stay at home... Help Keru in repelling the invasion of the Octodemons from the Universe of Chaos, and restablish the rule of love for higher glory of the Octopus God!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keru and the Guardians of the Universe is a top down puzzle shooter featuring octopuses capable of acquiring and using elemental power through arrows and other projectiles. The game has both single player and local multiplayer game modes for up to 4 players. This is a family game aimed at kids, but enjoyable for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure mode follows Keru, Guardian of Love, in his quest to match octopette couples while fighting invading octodemons, acquiring elemental powers, and solving puzzles through the use of elementally imbued arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the Universe - 8 planets are awaiting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain elemental powers - yes, love is an elemental power, didn't you know that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight octodemons - they are not bad, they are terrible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match octopettes - you are the Guardian of Love, remember?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight bosses - some Octodemons need capital 'Os'!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles - lots of items react to different elemental powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your lost family - you could have never told you were the son of the Octopus Gods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other available modes are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op for 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local competitive for 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local competitive for 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Futbito! (soccer with arrows for 2 or 4 players</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Keru and the Guardians of the Universe is a top down puzzle shooter. Playing as Keru, the youngest Guardian of the Universe, you will shoot arrows imbued with elemental power to solve puzzles and fight Octodemons and bosses from the Universe of Chaos. Travel the universe and reunite your family!",
